{
  "id": "flue_gases___dew_point_temperatures",
  "title": "Flue Gases - Dew Point Temperatures",
  "description": "Flue gas dew point temperatures and condensation of water vapor.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Flue Gases - Dew Point Temperatures\n\nCalculate dew point temperatures for flue gases and analyze water vapor condensation.\n\n## Overview\nThis calculator helps determine dew point temperatures in flue gas streams, which is critical for:\n- Preventing condensation in exhaust systems\n- Optimizing boiler efficiency\n- Protecting equipment from corrosion\n- Designing appropriate exhaust systems"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "flue_gas_temp",
          "label": "Flue Gas Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 150,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "oxygen_content",
          "label": "Oxygen Content (O₂)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 3,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        {
          "id": "sulfur_content",
          "label": "Fuel Sulfur Content",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.5,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        {
          "id": "water_vapor_content",
          "label": "Water Vapor Content",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10,
          "unit": "%"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "dew_point_temp",
          "label": "Dew Point Temperature",
          "unit": "°C",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "inputs.flue_gas_temp * 0.85"
        },
        {
          "id": "condensation_risk",
          "label": "Condensation Risk",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "inputs.flue_gas_temp - (inputs.flue_gas_temp * 0.85)"
        },
        {
          "id": "safety_margin",
          "label": "Safety Margin",
          "unit": "°C",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(inputs.flue_gas_temp - (inputs.flue_gas_temp * 0.85)) * (1 + inputs.oxygen_content / 100)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}